OL,3,GNEWSASDLP deselects MLA Justin McNulty
OL,4,Aas Newry and Armagh assembly candidate
OL,5,
OL,6,FJustin McNulty has not been selected by
OL,7,Fthe Social Democratic and Labour Party
OL,8,F(SDLP) to run in the Newry and Armagh
OL,9,Fconstituency for next year's Northern
OL,10,FIreland Assembly election.
OL,12,FCrossmaglen councillor Pete Byrne won
OL,13,Fthe vote at a selection convention in
OL,14,FNewry on Thursday night.
OL,16,FMcNulty has been an assembly member
OL,17,Fsince 2016.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
