OL,3,GNEWSASDLP deselects MLA Justin McNulty
OL,4,Aas Newry and Armagh assembly candidate
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2024, he was suspended from the
OL,7,Fparty after quitting Stormont early
OL,8,F"without permission" to manage a Gaelic
OL,9,Ffootball team, before later having the
OL,10,Fwhip restored.
